      "updated": 1792646773157,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "按 (keyHash, account) 存：policy · 已花额度（总额 + 每日）· inventory（这把 key 买到的 meme）\n· Summary{initialized, active, revoked}：revoked 是墓碑，同一把 key 永远不能再授予",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "按 (keyHash, account) 存：policy · 已花额度（总额 + 每日）· inventory（这把 key 买到的 meme）\n· Summary{initialized, active, revoked}：revoked 是墓碑，同一把 key 永远不能再授予",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
